<h1>9.Debug and correct a supplied buggy HTML file.</h1>
The buggy HTML file:

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Page<title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome</h2>
    <p>This is my website.
    <img src="photo.jpg">
</body>
</html>

Correct version:

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Page</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome</h1>
    <p>This is my website.</p>
    <img src="photo.jpg" alt="A photo">
</body>
</html>